{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BeQBnpV28qqWC4686XC2jx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"fewnerd_smoke\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type, 1-epoch LoRA fine-tune + 200-instance N=8 pilot. Gate for full run.\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"train_loss_1epoch\": 0.15,\n7\t      \"eval_loss_1epoch\": 0.12,\n8\t      \"greedy_f1_200inst\": 0.78,\n9\t      \"parse_rate\": 0.998,\n10\t      \"pilot_sj_rho_full\": 0.3,\n11\t      \"pilot_degeneracy_rate\": 0.22,\n12\t      \"pilot_oracle_f1\": 0.86,\n13\t      \"pilot_headroom_pp\": 8.0,\n14\t      \"inference_time_200inst_minutes\": 12,\n15\t      \"n_entity_types\": 8,\n16\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 8.5\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"tables\": [\n19\t      {\n20\t        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Smoke Test Summary\",\n21\t        \"columns\": [\n22\t          \"Metric\",\n23\t          \"Value\"\n24\t        ],\n25\t        \"rows\": [\n26\t          [\n27\t            \"Training loss (1 epoch)\",\n28\t            \"0.150\"\n29\t          ],\n30\t          [\n31\t            \"Greedy NER F1 (200 inst)\",\n32\t            \"0.780\"\n33\t          ],\n34\t          [\n35\t            \"Oracle NER F1\",\n36\t            \"0.860\"\n37\t          ],\n38\t          [\n39\t            \"Headroom\",\n40\t            \"8.0pp\"\n41\t          ],\n42\t          [\n43\t            \"Parse rate\",\n44\t            \"99.8%\"\n45\t          ],\n46\t          [\n47\t            \"Degeneracy rate (pilot)\",\n48\t            \"22%\"\n49\t          ],\n50\t          [\n51\t            \"SJ ρ (pilot)\",\n52\t            \"0.30\"\n53\t          ]\n54\t        ]\n55\t      }\n56\t    ],\n57\t    \"figures\": [],\n58\t    \"analysis\": \"Smoke test PASS。模型成功学会 Few-NERD 格式和 8 类实体标注。Greedy F1=0.78 介于 SciERC（0.66）和 CoNLL（0.91）之间，符合 Few-NERD 的中等难度定位。Degeneracy 初步估计 ~22%，低于 capability trap 线性外推的预测值（~35-40%），暗示 median tier 的'部分确认但不完美拟合'结论。Pipeline validated，proceed to exp-021。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA coarse（8类通用实体：Person, Organization, Location, Building, Product, Event, Art, Other）比 SciERC 更标准化但比 CoNLL 更细粒度。1-epoch LoRA 已足够让 Qwen3-8B 学会格式和基本类型映射（类似 SciERC ft_001 在 1 epoch 后 NER F1=0.60）。Few-NERD 训练集大（~66K samples），1 epoch 足以收敛基本模式。Greedy F1=0.78 符合 median 范围 [0.75, 0.85] 的下半段，因为只有 1 epoch。Degeneracy 0.22 在 pilot（200 inst）上初步可见但 CI 宽——这个 pilot 主要验证 pipeline 可行性，不做结论。\"\n59\t  },\n60\t  {\n61\t    \"name\": \"fewnerd_full\",\n62\t    \"description\": \"Few-NERD 3-epoch LoRA + full test set N=8, 3 seeds. 5 signals + degeneracy + selection.\",\n63\t    \"results\": {\n64\t      \"train_loss_3epoch\": 0.065,\n65\t      \"eval_loss_3epoch\": 0.078,\n66\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.812,\n67\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.895,\n68\t      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 8.3,\n69\t      \"n_test_instances\": 1500,\n70\t      \"n_valid_after_gold_filter\": 1380,\n71\t      \"parse_rate\": 0.999,\n72\t      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.26,\n73\t      \"degeneracy_rate_3seed_mean\": 0.25,\n74\t      \"degeneracy_rate_3seed_sd\": 0.018,\n75\t      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.33,\n76\t      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.28,\n77\t      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.25,\n78\t      \"em_rho_full\": 0.35,\n79\t      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.36,\n80\t      \"sj_auroc_full\": 0.72,\n81\t      \"em_auroc_full\": 0.78,\n82\t      \"voting_conf_auroc_full\": 0.73,\n83\t      \"logprob_auroc_full\": 0.68,\n84\t      \"sj_rho_cond\": 0.31,\n85\t      \"em_rho_cond\": 0.38,\n86\t      \"voting_conf_rho_cond\": 0.33,\n87\t      \"sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.32,\n88\t      \"sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.025,\n89\t      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.812,\n90\t      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.813,\n91\t      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.814,\n92\t      \"selection_f1_voting_conf\": 0.811,\n93\t      \"selection_f1_random\": 0.798,\n94\t      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.895,\n95\t      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": 0.2,\n96\t      \"selection_bootstrap_ci_95_low\": -0.8,\n97\t      \"selection_bootstrap_ci_95_high\": 1.2,\n98\t      \"selection_permutation_p\": 0.42,\n99\t      \"capability_trap_f1_vs_degeneracy_r2_with_fewnerd\": 0.72,\n100\t      \"capability_trap_monotonicity\": true,\n101\t      \"lp_within_instance_range_median\": 0.038,\n102\t      \"lp_tied_fraction\": 0.31,\n103\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 6.2\n104\t    },\n105\t    \"tables\": [\n106\t      {\n107\t        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Full Results — QE Correlation (ρ, 3-seed mean±sd)\",\n108\t        \"columns\": [\n109\t          \"Signal\",\n110\t          \"NER ρ (full)\",\n111\t          \"NER ρ (cond)\",\n112\t          \"AUROC\"\n113\t        ],\n114\t        \"rows\": [\n115\t          [\n116\t            \"Voting_conf\",\n117\t            \"0.360±0.022\",\n118\t            \"0.330±0.028\",\n119\t            \"0.730\"\n120\t          ],\n121\t          [\n122\t            \"EM\",\n123\t            \"0.350±0.019\",\n124\t            \"0.380±0.024\",\n125\t            \"0.780\"\n126\t          ],\n127\t          [\n128\t            \"SJ\",\n129\t            \"0.320±0.025\",\n130\t            \"0.310±0.030\",\n131\t            \"0.720\"\n132\t          ],\n133\t          [\n134\t            \"FK\",\n135\t            \"0.280±0.020\",\n136\t            \"0.260±0.025\",\n137\t            \"0.660\"\n138\t          ],\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Logprob\",\n141\t            \"0.250±0.018\",\n142\t            \"0.220±0.022\",\n143\t            \"0.680\"\n144\t          ]\n145\t        ]\n146\t      },\n147\t      {\n148\t        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Selection F1 (N=8, T=1.0)\",\n149\t        \"columns\": [\n150\t          \"Method\",\n151\t          \"F1\",\n152\t          \"Δ vs greedy (pp)\"\n153\t        ],\n154\t        \"rows\": [\n155\t          [\n156\t            \"Oracle\",\n157\t            \"0.895\",\n158\t            \"+8.3\"\n159\t          ],\n160\t          [\n161\t            \"Logprob\",\n162\t            \"0.814\",\n163\t            \"+0.2\"\n164\t          ],\n165\t          [\n166\t            \"SJ\",\n167\t            \"0.813\",\n168\t            \"+0.1\"\n169\t          ],\n170\t          [\n171\t            \"Greedy (T=0)\",\n172\t            \"0.812\",\n173\t            \"—\"\n174\t          ],\n175\t          [\n176\t            \"Voting_conf\",\n177\t            \"0.811\",\n178\t            \"-0.1\"\n179\t          ],\n180\t          [\n181\t            \"Random\",\n182\t            \"0.798\",\n183\t            \"-1.4\"\n184\t          ]\n185\t        ]\n186\t      },\n187\t      {\n188\t        \"name\": \"Table: Capability Trap — Cross-Dataset Degeneracy\",\n189\t        \"columns\": [\n190\t          \"Dataset\",\n191\t          \"Greedy F1\",\n192\t          \"Degeneracy %\",\n193\t          \"Predicted %\",\n194\t          \"Residual\"\n195\t        ],\n196\t        \"rows\": [\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n199\t            \"0.912\",\n200\t            \"58%\",\n201\t            \"—\",\n202\t            \"—\"\n203\t          ],\n204\t          [\n205\t            \"Few-NERD\",\n206\t            \"0.812\",\n207\t            \"26%\",\n208\t            \"38%\",\n209\t            \"-12pp\"\n210\t          ],\n211\t          [\n212\t            \"SciERC\",\n213\t            \"0.663\",\n214\t            \"21%\",\n215\t            \"—\",\n216\t            \"—\"\n217\t          ],\n218\t          [\n219\t            \"WNUT-17\",\n220\t            \"0.523\",\n221\t            \"~0%\",\n222\t            \"—\",\n223\t            \"—\"\n224\t          ]\n225\t        ]\n226\t      }\n227\t    ],\n228\t    \"figures\": [],\n229\t    \"analysis\": \"Few-NERD 为 capability trap 提供 partial confirmation：degeneracy 单调性成立（F1 越高，degeneracy 越高），但 R² 从 3-point 的 0.95+ 下降到 4-point 的 0.72。这要求将 capability trap 从 'structural inevitability' 调整为 'primary contributing factor'，因为 task structure（类型数量、实体密度）引入了不可忽略的 residual。Selection 结果（+0.2pp, p=0.42）处于 median 定义的模糊区间——不显著优于 greedy，但也没有像 SciERC 那样 greedy 明确 dominate。这使得 'universally fail' 需弱化为 'predominantly fail'。QE signals 仍然有效（SJ ρ=0.32 > LP ρ=0.25），支撑 Claim 2 的 QE framework contribution。\\n\\n3-epoch fine-tune 使 greedy F1 从 smoke 的 0.78 提升到 0.812，对应 median 范围 [0.75,0.85] 的中部。Degeneracy rate 0.26 的关键逻辑：capability trap 预测在 F1=0.81 时 degeneracy 应~38%（CoNLL 0.91→58%, SciERC 0.66→21% 的线性外推），但实际只有 26%。原因：(1) Few-NERD 有 8 种实体类型（vs CoNLL 的 4 种），类型多样性提供更多变异维度，使得即使 overall F1 高，individual spans 仍有组合空间；(2) Few-NERD 实例更长/实体更密，per-instance 的 combinatorial space 抑制了完全 convergence。这就是 median 的核心信号：monotonicity 成立（F1 越高 degeneracy 越高），但 R²=0.72 而非 0.95——task structure（类型数、实体密度）是 residual variance 的来源。Selection gap +0.2pp 的逻辑：degeneracy 26% 介于 SciERC（21%，gap≈0）和 CoNLL（58%，gap≈0）之间，bootstrap p=0.42 说明完全不显著。信号排序 VC>EM>SJ>FK>LP 与 CoNLL 类似但 SJ-LP gap 更小（0.08 vs SciERC 的 0.15），因为 8 类系统的 LP 信号比 6 类科学文本更 informative。\"\n230\t  },\n231\t  {\n232\t    \"name\": \"3rd_seed_scierc\",\n233\t    \"description\": \"SciERC NER+RE N=8, seed=789. 第3个 seed 用于 Fisher combined p-value。\",\n234\t    \"results\": {\n235\t      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.661,\n236\t      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.779,\n237\t      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 11.8,\n238\t      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.372,\n239\t      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.258,\n240\t      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.218,\n241\t      \"ner_em_rho_full\": 0.305,\n242\t      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.388,\n243\t      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.698,\n244\t      \"ner_em_auroc\": 0.755,\n245\t      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.415,\n246\t      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.582,\n247\t      \"re_headroom_pp\": 16.7,\n248\t      \"re_sj_rho_full\": 0.258,\n249\t      \"re_fk_rho_full\": 0.285,\n250\t      \"re_logprob_rho_full\": 0.242,\n251\t      \"re_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.34,\n252\t      \"re_sample_f1_pct_zero\": 44.8,\n253\t      \"re_lp_gt_sj\": false,\n254\t      \"re_sj_minus_lp_rho\": 0.016,\n255\t      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.381,\n256\t      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.032,\n257\t      \"re_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.261,\n258\t      \"re_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.012,\n259\t      \"re_lp_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.268,\n260\t      \"re_lp_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.038,\n261\t      \"fisher_combined_p_sj_gt_lp_ner\": 0.028,\n262\t      \"fisher_combined_p_sj_gt_lp_ner_significant\": true,\n263\t      \"fisher_combined_p_lp_gt_sj_re\": 0.085,\n264\t      \"fisher_combined_p_lp_gt_sj_re_significant\": false,\n265\t      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.661,\n266\t      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.654,\n267\t      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.651,\n268\t      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.779,\n269\t      \"degeneracy_rate_ner\": 0.23,\n270\t      \"n_instances\": 529,\n271\t      \"parse_rate\": 1.0\n272\t    },\n273\t    \"tables\": [\n274\t      {\n275\t        \"name\": \"Table: 3-Seed SciERC NER ρ Stability\",\n276\t        \"columns\": [\n277\t          \"Signal\",\n278\t          \"Seed 42\",\n279\t          \"Seed 123\",\n280\t          \"Seed 789\",\n281\t          \"Mean\",\n282\t          \"SD\"\n283\t        ],\n284\t        \"rows\": [\n285\t          [\n286\t            \"SJ\",\n287\t            \"0.383\",\n288\t            \"0.384\",\n289\t            \"0.372\",\n290\t            \"0.381\",\n291\t            \"0.032\"\n292\t          ],\n293\t          [\n294\t            \"FK\",\n295\t            \"0.259\",\n296\t            \"0.266\",\n297\t            \"0.258\",\n298\t            \"0.261\",\n299\t            \"0.004\"\n300\t          ],\n301\t          [\n302\t            \"LP\",\n303\t            \"0.205\",\n304\t            \"0.226\",\n305\t            \"0.218\",\n306\t            \"0.216\",\n307\t            \"0.011\"\n308\t          ],\n309\t          [\n310\t            \"VC\",\n311\t            \"0.379\",\n312\t            \"0.407\",\n313\t            \"0.388\",\n314\t            \"0.391\",\n315\t            \"0.014\"\n316\t          ],\n317\t          [\n318\t            \"EM\",\n319\t            \"0.295\",\n320\t            \"0.299\",\n321\t            \"0.305\",\n322\t            \"0.300\",\n323\t            \"0.005\"\n324\t          ]\n325\t        ]\n326\t      },\n327\t      {\n328\t        \"name\": \"Table: 3-Seed SciERC RE ρ — LP vs SJ Ranking\",\n329\t        \"columns\": [\n330\t          \"Signal\",\n331\t          \"Seed 42\",\n332\t          \"Seed 123\",\n333\t          \"Seed 789\",\n334\t          \"Mean\",\n335\t          \"SD\"\n336\t        ],\n337\t        \"rows\": [\n338\t          [\n339\t            \"LP\",\n340\t            \"0.267\",\n341\t            \"0.300\",\n342\t            \"0.242\",\n343\t            \"0.270\",\n344\t            \"0.029\"\n345\t          ],\n346\t          [\n347\t            \"SJ\",\n348\t            \"0.250\",\n349\t            \"0.283\",\n350\t            \"0.258\",\n351\t            \"0.264\",\n352\t            \"0.017\"\n353\t          ],\n354\t          [\n355\t            \"LP>SJ?\",\n356\t            \"Yes (+0.017)\",\n357\t            \"Yes (+0.017)\",\n358\t            \"No (-0.016)\",\n359\t            \"—\",\n360\t            \"—\"\n361\t          ]\n362\t        ]\n363\t      },\n364\t      {\n365\t        \"name\": \"Table: Fisher Combined p-values (3 seeds)\",\n366\t        \"columns\": [\n367\t          \"Hypothesis\",\n368\t          \"Fisher χ²\",\n369\t          \"df\",\n370\t          \"p\",\n371\t          \"Significant?\"\n372\t        ],\n373\t        \"rows\": [\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"NER: SJ > LP\",\n376\t            \"14.2\",\n377\t            \"6\",\n378\t            \"0.028\",\n379\t            \"Yes (p<0.05)\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"RE: LP > SJ\",\n383\t            \"10.8\",\n384\t            \"6\",\n385\t            \"0.085\",\n386\t            \"No\"\n387\t          ]\n388\t        ]\n389\t      }\n390\t    ],\n391\t    \"figures\": [],\n392\t    \"analysis\": \"第3个 seed 确认 NER 结论完全稳定（SJ > LP, Fisher p=0.028）。RE 上 LP>SJ 的 ranking 在 seed 789 翻转（SJ 0.258 > LP 0.242），使得 3-seed Fisher p=0.085 未达显著水平。这是 median tier 的核心特征之一：RE signal ranking 不够 robust 以做 definitive claim。Paper 中需表述为 'LP tends to outperform structural signals on RE (2/3 seeds), likely due to binary dominance mechanism, though this advantage does not reach statistical significance across all random seeds (Fisher p=0.085).' Primary claims（capability trap、NER structural>surface、selection fails）在 3-seed 下完全稳定。\\n\\nSeed=789 的 NER 结果高度稳定（SJ ρ=0.372 vs 已有 seeds 0.383/0.384/0.360，3-seed SD=0.032 落入 median 范围 [0.02, 0.045]）。关键 median 特征在 RE：seed 789 上 SJ ρ=0.258 略高于 LP ρ=0.242，打破了 seeds 42/123 上 LP>SJ 的 pattern（seed42: LP 0.267 > SJ 0.250; seed123: LP 0.300 > SJ 0.283）。这使得 Fisher combined p for LP>SJ on RE = 0.085（不显著）。翻转原因：RE 的 zero-F1 rate 在不同 seeds 间波动（43-45%），seed=789 恰好有较少的 'complete failure' instances 进入 high-LP bin，削弱了 LP 的 binary classification 优势。NER 上 SJ>LP 的 Fisher p=0.028 仍然显著，支撑 'structural signals dominate for NER' 的结论。但 RE signal ranking 的不稳定性要求将 'LP>SJ for RE' 从 'definitive finding' 降级为 'tendency across most seeds'。\"\n393\t  },\n394\t  {\n395\t    \"name\": \"lora_rank8_ablation\",\n396\t    \"description\": \"LoRA rank=8 (vs baseline rank=16) fine-tune on SciERC + N=8 inference. Tests fine-tuning intensity vs capability as degeneracy driver.\",\n397\t    \"results\": {\n398\t      \"train_loss_5epoch\": 0.095,\n399\t      \"eval_loss_5epoch\": 0.105,\n400\t      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.641,\n401\t      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.782,\n402\t      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 14.1,\n403\t      \"degeneracy_rate_r8\": 0.12,\n404\t      \"degeneracy_rate_r16_baseline\": 0.21,\n405\t      \"degeneracy_delta_pp\": 9.0,\n406\t      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.365,\n407\t      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.27,\n408\t      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.195,\n409\t      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.39,\n410\t      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.69,\n411\t      \"selection_f1_greedy_r8\": 0.641,\n412\t      \"selection_f1_logprob_r8\": 0.644,\n413\t      \"selection_f1_sj_r8\": 0.642,\n414\t      \"selection_f1_oracle_r8\": 0.782,\n415\t      \"selection_gap_logprob_minus_greedy_pp\": 0.3,\n416\t      \"lp_within_instance_range_median_r8\": 0.048,\n417\t      \"lp_tied_fraction_r8\": 0.14,\n418\t      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.385,\n419\t      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.568,\n420\t      \"re_degeneracy_rate_r8\": 0.08,\n421\t      \"re_sample_f1_pct_zero\": 48.2,\n422\t      \"greedy_f1_delta_r8_minus_r16\": -0.022,\n423\t      \"sj_rho_delta_r8_minus_r16\": 0.005,\n424\t      \"headroom_delta_r8_minus_r16_pp\": 3.0,\n425\t      \"non_degen_selection_gap_pp\": 2.1,\n426\t      \"n_instances\": 529,\n427\t      \"parse_rate\": 0.995\n428\t    },\n429\t    \"tables\": [\n430\t      {\n431\t        \"name\": \"Table: LoRA Rank Ablation — Degeneracy & Performance\",\n432\t        \"columns\": [\n433\t          \"Metric\",\n434\t          \"Rank=16 (baseline)\",\n435\t          \"Rank=8\",\n436\t          \"Δ\"\n437\t        ],\n438\t        \"rows\": [\n439\t          [\n440\t            \"NER Greedy F1\",\n441\t            \"0.663\",\n442\t            \"0.641\",\n443\t            \"-2.2pp\"\n444\t          ],\n445\t          [\n446\t            \"NER Oracle F1\",\n447\t            \"0.776\",\n448\t            \"0.782\",\n449\t            \"+0.6pp\"\n450\t          ],\n451\t          [\n452\t            \"NER Headroom\",\n453\t            \"11.3pp\",\n454\t            \"14.1pp\",\n455\t            \"+2.8pp\"\n456\t          ],\n457\t          [\n458\t            \"NER Degeneracy %\",\n459\t            \"21%\",\n460\t            \"12%\",\n461\t            \"-9pp\"\n462\t          ],\n463\t          [\n464\t            \"LP range (median nats)\",\n465\t            \"0.041\",\n466\t            \"0.048\",\n467\t            \"+17%\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"LP tied fraction\",\n471\t            \"0.21\",\n472\t            \"0.14\",\n473\t            \"-7pp\"\n474\t          ],\n475\t          [\n476\t            \"NER SJ ρ\",\n477\t            \"0.383\",\n478\t            \"0.365\",\n479\t            \"-0.018\"\n480\t          ],\n481\t          [\n482\t            \"Best selection F1\",\n483\t            \"0.650 (LP)\",\n484\t            \"0.644 (LP)\",\n485\t            \"-0.6pp\"\n486\t          ]\n487\t        ]\n488\t      },\n489\t      {\n490\t        \"name\": \"Table: Degeneracy Attribution (NER)\",\n491\t        \"columns\": [\n492\t          \"Driver\",\n493\t          \"Predicted Δ degen\",\n494\t          \"Actual Δ degen\",\n495\t          \"Attribution %\"\n496\t        ],\n497\t        \"rows\": [\n498\t          [\n499\t            \"Capability (F1 drop 0.66→0.64)\",\n500\t            \"-2pp\",\n501\t            \"—\",\n502\t            \"22%\"\n503\t          ],\n504\t          [\n505\t            \"Fine-tuning intensity (rank 16→8)\",\n506\t            \"—\",\n507\t            \"-7pp\",\n508\t            \"78%\"\n509\t          ],\n510\t          [\n511\t            \"Total observed\",\n512\t            \"—\",\n513\t            \"-9pp\",\n514\t            \"100%\"\n515\t          ]\n516\t        ]\n517\t      },\n518\t      {\n519\t        \"name\": \"Table: Non-degenerate Subset Analysis (rank=8)\",\n520\t        \"columns\": [\n521\t          \"Subset\",\n522\t          \"n\",\n523\t          \"LP selection gap\",\n524\t          \"SJ selection gap\"\n525\t        ],\n526\t        \"rows\": [\n527\t          [\n528\t            \"All instances\",\n529\t            \"529\",\n530\t            \"+0.3pp\",\n531\t            \"+0.1pp\"\n532\t          ],\n533\t          [\n534\t            \"Non-degenerate only\",\n535\t            \"465\",\n536\t            \"+2.1pp\",\n537\t            \"+1.5pp\"\n538\t          ],\n539\t          [\n540\t            \"Non-degen, rank=16 baseline\",\n541\t            \"418\",\n542\t            \"+2.9pp (p=0.01)\",\n543\t            \"+1.8pp\"\n544\t          ]\n545\t        ]\n546\t      }\n547\t    ],\n548\t    \"figures\": [],\n549\t    \"analysis\": \"LoRA rank=8 ablation 是 median tier 的 defining experiment。Degeneracy 下降 9pp（从 21% 到 12%）中，capability drop（F1 -2.2pp）仅能解释约 2pp，剩余 7pp 必须归因于 fine-tuning intensity itself。这迫使论文承认 capability trap 不是 sole driver——fine-tuning regime 是 independent contributing factor。但关键上下文是：跨 dataset 的 degeneracy variation（CoNLL 58% vs SciERC 21% = 37pp range）远大于 rank ablation 的 9pp，所以 capability 仍是 'dominant factor'。Paper framing 调整为：'Output convergence is driven by model capability (primary, explaining cross-dataset variance) AND fine-tuning intensity (secondary, contributing 5-15pp within-dataset). The capability trap remains the unifying explanation for why test-time scaling provides diminishing returns as model quality improves.' Selection 仍然 fails 即使 degeneracy 降低，因为 LP compression 是 independent bottleneck（不随 LoRA rank 改变）。\\n\\nLoRA rank=8 的参数容量是 rank=16 的一半，模型 fine-tuning 强度更低。这导致两个效果：(1) greedy F1 略降（0.641 vs 0.663，-2.2pp），因为模型对 SciERC schema 的记忆不如 rank=16 完整；(2) 输出多样性更高，因为 lower-rank adaptation 保留了更多 base model 的 stochastic behavior，degeneracy 从 21% 降到 12%（-9pp，落入 median 范围 [5,15]）。关键逻辑：如果 degeneracy 纯粹由 capability 驱动，则 F1 降低应该已经自动解释 degeneracy 下降（按 capability trap curve：F1 从 0.66 降到 0.64 预测 degeneracy 从 21% 降到 ~19%，仅 -2pp）。但实际下降 9pp >> 2pp 的 capability-predicted 下降，说明 fine-tuning intensity 本身是 independent contributing factor。Median 解读：capability trap 解释了约 22% 的 degeneracy reduction（2/9），fine-tuning intensity 解释了剩余 78%。但 capability 仍是跨 dataset 的 primary driver（CoNLL 58% vs SciERC 21% 的差异远大于 rank ablation 的 9pp）。LP compression 也略微缓解（range median 0.048 vs 0.041），因为 lower fine-tuning 保留了更多 generation-level diversity。Selection 仍不显著（+0.3pp），因为即使 degeneracy 降低，LP compression 仍存在。\"\n550\t  },\n551\t  {\n552\t    \"name\": \"claim_audit\",\n553\t    \"description\": \"Cross-chapter numerical consistency audit. 检查所有定量 claims vs source data。\",\n554\t    \"results\": {\n555\t      \"contradictions_found\": 3,\n556\t      \"contradiction_1\": {\n557\t        \"location\": \"Discussion vs Limitations\",\n558\t        \"issue\": \"Discussion says '+0.1pp over single-sample', Limitations says '+0.4pp over greedy'\",\n559\t        \"resolution\": \"Both refer to different comparisons: +0.1pp = best signal vs random single, +0.4pp (incorrect) should be +0.6pp = LP vs greedy (from exp_016_rerun_1024). Standardize to LP vs greedy +0.6pp throughout.\"\n560\t      },\n561\t      \"contradiction_2\": {\n562\t        \"location\": \"Abstract vs Results\",\n563\t        \"issue\": \"Abstract claims 'AUROC up to 0.82' but Results table shows max 0.749 (EM on NER)\",\n564\t        \"resolution\": \"0.82 comes from CoNLL (SJ AUROC=0.8008 in exp_002, EM AUROC=0.8156). Must specify which dataset in Abstract or use max across all: CoNLL EM AUROC 0.82.\"\n565\t      },\n566\t      \"contradiction_3\": {\n567\t        \"location\": \"Intro vs Section 5\",\n568\t        \"issue\": \"Intro claims '21-58% of instances produce identical F1' — percentages are from 1024-token data but cited numbers use mixed sources\",\n569\t        \"resolution\": \"Verify degeneracy rates from consistent 1024-token runs. SciERC (1024): ~21% (from exp_012_rerun_1024 tied fraction). CoNLL: derive from exp_002 data.\"\n570\t      },\n571\t      \"minor_issues_found\": 4,\n572\t      \"total_resolution_time_hours\": 2\n573\t    },\n574\t    \"tables\": [\n575\t      {\n576\t        \"name\": \"Table: Claim Audit Summary\",\n577\t        \"columns\": [\n578\t          \"Issue Type\",\n579\t          \"Count\",\n580\t          \"Severity\"\n581\t        ],\n582\t        \"rows\": [\n583\t          [\n584\t            \"Major numerical contradiction\",\n585\t            \"3\",\n586\t            \"Must fix before submission\"\n587\t          ],\n588\t          [\n589\t            \"Minor rounding/precision inconsistency\",\n590\t            \"4\",\n591\t            \"Fix in final pass\"\n592\t          ],\n593\t          [\n594\t            \"Stale reference to old experiment\",\n595\t            \"2\",\n596\t            \"Update citation\"\n597\t          ],\n598\t          [\n599\t            \"Missing CI/p-value for claimed significance\",\n600\t            \"1\",\n601\t            \"Add from bootstrap data\"\n602\t          ]\n603\t        ]\n604\t      }\n605\t    ],\n606\t    \"figures\": [],\n607\t    \"analysis\": \"Audit 发现 3 个需要修正的矛盾，均为 presentation-level 问题。最关键的是 Discussion/Limitations 中对 selection gap magnitude 的不一致引用——这在 median tier 下尤其敏感，因为 adjusted claims 要求精确措辞（'predominantly fail' 而非 'universally fail'）。所有矛盾均可通过引用正确的 source experiment（exp_012_rerun_1024 为 SciERC 的 canonical source，exp_002 为 CoNLL）解决。无 methodological 问题。建议统一使用 1024-token pipeline 数据作为 paper 中所有 SciERC metrics 的来源。\\n\\nNumerical inconsistencies 是 paper 在多轮实验迭代中积累的必然结果。本项目经历了 512→1024 token 数据迁移、gold-empty filtering pipeline 修正、多 seed 数值更新等，每次都有部分 claims 未同步更新。Median tier 假设找到 3 个显著矛盾（realistic for a ~8-page paper with dense quantitative claims）而非 catastrophic level（>5）的问题。这些都是 presentational issues 而非 methodological problems——底层实验数据一致。\"\n608\t  }\n609\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8502501-34ec-4d3f-9eb5-b04016e60696","uuid":"4d0e3499-b35d-486c-9dae-40ccb3667a36","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:54:22.958Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T092241/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"fewnerd_smoke\",\n    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type, 1-epoch LoRA fine-tune + 200-instance N=8 pilot. Gate for full run.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"train_loss_1epoch\": 0.15,\n      \"eval_loss_1epoch\": 0.12,\n      \"greedy_f1_200inst\": 0.78,\n      \"parse_rate\": 0.998,\n      \"pilot_sj_rho_full\": 0.3,\n      \"pilot_degeneracy_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"pilot_oracle_f1\": 0.86,\n      \"pilot_headroom_pp\": 8.0,\n      \"inference_time_200inst_minutes\": 12,\n      \"n_entity_types\": 8,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 8.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Smoke Test Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Training loss (1 epoch)\",\n            \"0.150\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Greedy NER F1 (200 inst)\",\n            \"0.780\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle NER F1\",\n            \"0.860\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Headroom\",\n            \"8.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Parse rate\",\n            \"99.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Degeneracy rate (pilot)\",\n            \"22%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ ρ (pilot)\",\n            \"0.30\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Smoke test PASS。模型成功学会 Few-NERD 格式和 8 类实体标注。Greedy F1=0.78 介于 SciERC（0.66）和 CoNLL（0.91）之间，符合 Few-NERD 的中等难度定位。Degeneracy 初步估计 ~22%，低于 capability trap 线性外推的预测值（~35-40%），暗示 median tier 的'部分确认但不完美拟合'结论。Pipeline validated，proceed to exp-021。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA coarse（8类通用实体：Person, Organization, Location, Building, Product, Event, Art, Other）比 SciERC 更标准化但比 CoNLL 更细粒度。1-epoch LoRA 已足够让 Qwen3-8B 学会格式和基本类型映射（类似 SciERC ft_001 在 1 epoch 后 NER F1=0.60）。Few-NERD 训练集大（~66K samples），1 epoch 足以收敛基本模式。Greedy F1=0.78 符合 median 范围 [0.75, 0.85] 的下半段，因为只有 1 epoch。Degeneracy 0.22 在 pilot（200 inst）上初步可见但 CI 宽——这个 pilot 主要验证 pipeline 可行性，不做结论。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"fewnerd_full\",\n    \"description\": \"Few-NERD 3-epoch LoRA + full test set N=8, 3 seeds. 5 signals + degeneracy + selection.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"train_loss_3epoch\": 0.065,\n      \"eval_loss_3epoch\": 0.078,\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.812,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.895,\n      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 8.3,\n      \"n_test_instances\": 1500,\n      \"n_valid_after_gold_filter\": 1380,\n      \"parse_rate\": 0.999,\n      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.26,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_3seed_mean\": 0.25,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_3seed_sd\": 0.018,\n      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.33,\n      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.28,\n      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.25,\n      \"em_rho_full\": 0.35,\n      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.36,\n      \"sj_auroc_full\": 0.72,\n      \"em_auroc_full\": 0.78,\n      \"voting_conf_auroc_full\": 0.73,\n      \"logprob_auroc_full\": 0.68,\n      \"sj_rho_cond\": 0.31,\n      \"em_rho_cond\": 0.38,\n      \"voting_conf_rho_cond\": 0.33,\n      \"sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.32,\n      \"sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.025,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.812,\n      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.813,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.814,\n      \"selection_f1_voting_conf\": 0.811,\n      \"selection_f1_random\": 0.798,\n      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.895,\n      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": 0.2,\n      \"selection_bootstrap_ci_95_low\": -0.8,\n      \"selection_bootstrap_ci_95_high\": 1.2,\n      \"selection_permutation_p\": 0.42,\n      \"capability_trap_f1_vs_degeneracy_r2_with_fewnerd\": 0.72,\n      \"capability_trap_monotonicity\": true,\n      \"lp_within_instance_range_median\": 0.038,\n      \"lp_tied_fraction\": 0.31,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 6.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Full Results — QE Correlation (ρ, 3-seed mean±sd)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Signal\",\n          \"NER ρ (full)\",\n          \"NER ρ (cond)\",\n          \"AUROC\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Voting_conf\",\n            \"0.360±0.022\",\n            \"0.330±0.028\",\n            \"0.730\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EM\",\n            \"0.350±0.019\",\n            \"0.380±0.024\",\n            \"0.780\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            \"0.320±0.025\",\n            \"0.310±0.030\",\n            \"0.720\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            \"0.280±0.020\",\n            \"0.260±0.025\",\n            \"0.660\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Logprob\",\n            \"0.250±0.018\",\n            \"0.220±0.022\",\n            \"0.680\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Few-NERD Selection F1 (N=8, T=1.0)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"F1\",\n          \"Δ vs greedy (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Oracle\",\n            \"0.895\",\n            \"+8.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Logprob\",\n            \"0.814\",\n            \"+0.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            \"0.813\",\n            \"+0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Greedy (T=0)\",\n            \"0.812\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Voting_conf\",\n            \"0.811\",\n            \"-0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random\",\n            \"0.798\",\n            \"-1.4\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Capability Trap — Cross-Dataset Degeneracy\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"Greedy F1\",\n          \"Degeneracy %\",\n          \"Predicted %\",\n          \"Residual\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n            \"0.912\",\n            \"58%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Few-NERD\",\n            \"0.812\",\n            \"26%\",\n            \"38%\",\n            \"-12pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SciERC\",\n            \"0.663\",\n            \"21%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"WNUT-17\",\n            \"0.523\",\n            \"~0%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Few-NERD 为 capability trap 提供 partial confirmation：degeneracy 单调性成立（F1 越高，degeneracy 越高），但 R² 从 3-point 的 0.95+ 下降到 4-point 的 0.72。这要求将 capability trap 从 'structural inevitability' 调整为 'primary contributing factor'，因为 task structure（类型数量、实体密度）引入了不可忽略的 residual。Selection 结果（+0.2pp, p=0.42）处于 median 定义的模糊区间——不显著优于 greedy，但也没有像 SciERC 那样 greedy 明确 dominate。这使得 'universally fail' 需弱化为 'predominantly fail'。QE signals 仍然有效（SJ ρ=0.32 > LP ρ=0.25），支撑 Claim 2 的 QE framework contribution。\\n\\n3-epoch fine-tune 使 greedy F1 从 smoke 的 0.78 提升到 0.812，对应 median 范围 [0.75,0.85] 的中部。Degeneracy rate 0.26 的关键逻辑：capability trap 预测在 F1=0.81 时 degeneracy 应~38%（CoNLL 0.91→58%, SciERC 0.66→21% 的线性外推），但实际只有 26%。原因：(1) Few-NERD 有 8 种实体类型（vs CoNLL 的 4 种），类型多样性提供更多变异维度，使得即使 overall F1 高，individual spans 仍有组合空间；(2) Few-NERD 实例更长/实体更密，per-instance 的 combinatorial space 抑制了完全 convergence。这就是 median 的核心信号：monotonicity 成立（F1 越高 degeneracy 越高），但 R²=0.72 而非 0.95——task structure（类型数、实体密度）是 residual variance 的来源。Selection gap +0.2pp 的逻辑：degeneracy 26% 介于 SciERC（21%，gap≈0）和 CoNLL（58%，gap≈0）之间，bootstrap p=0.42 说明完全不显著。信号排序 VC>EM>SJ>FK>LP 与 CoNLL 类似但 SJ-LP gap 更小（0.08 vs SciERC 的 0.15），因为 8 类系统的 LP 信号比 6 类科学文本更 informative。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"3rd_seed_scierc\",\n    \"description\": \"SciERC NER+RE N=8, seed=789. 第3个 seed 用于 Fisher combined p-value。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.661,\n      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.779,\n      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 11.8,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.372,\n      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.258,\n      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.218,\n      \"ner_em_rho_full\": 0.305,\n      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.388,\n      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.698,\n      \"ner_em_auroc\": 0.755,\n      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.415,\n      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.582,\n      \"re_headroom_pp\": 16.7,\n      \"re_sj_rho_full\": 0.258,\n      \"re_fk_rho_full\": 0.285,\n      \"re_logprob_rho_full\": 0.242,\n      \"re_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.34,\n      \"re_sample_f1_pct_zero\": 44.8,\n      \"re_lp_gt_sj\": false,\n      \"re_sj_minus_lp_rho\": 0.016,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.381,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.032,\n      \"re_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.261,\n      \"re_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.012,\n      \"re_lp_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.268,\n      \"re_lp_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.038,\n      \"fisher_combined_p_sj_gt_lp_ner\": 0.028,\n      \"fisher_combined_p_sj_gt_lp_ner_significant\": true,\n      \"fisher_combined_p_lp_gt_sj_re\": 0.085,\n      \"fisher_combined_p_lp_gt_sj_re_significant\": false,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.661,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.654,\n      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.651,\n      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.779,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_ner\": 0.23,\n      \"n_instances\": 529,\n      \"parse_rate\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 3-Seed SciERC NER ρ Stability\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Signal\",\n          \"Seed 42\",\n          \"Seed 123\",\n          \"Seed 789\",\n          \"Mean\",\n          \"SD\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            \"0.383\",\n            \"0.384\",\n            \"0.372\",\n            \"0.381\",\n            \"0.032\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            \"0.259\",\n            \"0.266\",\n            \"0.258\",\n            \"0.261\",\n            \"0.004\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LP\",\n            \"0.205\",\n            \"0.226\",\n            \"0.218\",\n            \"0.216\",\n            \"0.011\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VC\",\n            \"0.379\",\n            \"0.407\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"0.391\",\n            \"0.014\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EM\",\n            \"0.295\",\n            \"0.299\",\n            \"0.305\",\n            \"0.300\",\n            \"0.005\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 3-Seed SciERC RE ρ — LP vs SJ Ranking\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Signal\",\n          \"Seed 42\",\n          \"Seed 123\",\n          \"Seed 789\",\n          \"Mean\",\n          \"SD\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"LP\",\n            \"0.267\",\n            \"0.300\",\n            \"0.242\",\n            \"0.270\",\n            \"0.029\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            \"0.250\",\n            \"0.283\",\n            \"0.258\",\n            \"0.264\",\n            \"0.017\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LP>SJ?\",\n            \"Yes (+0.017)\",\n            \"Yes (+0.017)\",\n            \"No (-0.016)\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Fisher Combined p-values (3 seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Hypothesis\",\n          \"Fisher χ²\",\n          \"df\",\n          \"p\",\n          \"Significant?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NER: SJ > LP\",\n            \"14.2\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.028\",\n            \"Yes (p<0.05)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RE: LP > SJ\",\n            \"10.8\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.085\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第3个 seed 确认 NER 结论完全稳定（SJ > LP, Fisher p=0.028）。RE 上 LP>SJ 的 ranking 在 seed 789 翻转（SJ 0.258 > LP 0.242），使得 3-seed Fisher p=0.085 未达显著水平。这是 median tier 的核心特征之一：RE signal ranking 不够 robust 以做 definitive claim。Paper 中需表述为 'LP tends to outperform structural signals on RE (2/3 seeds), likely due to binary dominance mechanism, though this advantage does not reach statistical significance across all random seeds (Fisher p=0.085).' Primary claims（capability trap、NER structural>surface、selection fails）在 3-seed 下完全稳定。\\n\\nSeed=789 的 NER 结果高度稳定（SJ ρ=0.372 vs 已有 seeds 0.383/0.384/0.360，3-seed SD=0.032 落入 median 范围 [0.02, 0.045]）。关键 median 特征在 RE：seed 789 上 SJ ρ=0.258 略高于 LP ρ=0.242，打破了 seeds 42/123 上 LP>SJ 的 pattern（seed42: LP 0.267 > SJ 0.250; seed123: LP 0.300 > SJ 0.283）。这使得 Fisher combined p for LP>SJ on RE = 0.085（不显著）。翻转原因：RE 的 zero-F1 rate 在不同 seeds 间波动（43-45%），seed=789 恰好有较少的 'complete failure' instances 进入 high-LP bin，削弱了 LP 的 binary classification 优势。NER 上 SJ>LP 的 Fisher p=0.028 仍然显著，支撑 'structural signals dominate for NER' 的结论。但 RE signal ranking 的不稳定性要求将 'LP>SJ for RE' 从 'definitive finding' 降级为 'tendency across most seeds'。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"lora_rank8_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"LoRA rank=8 (vs baseline rank=16) fine-tune on SciERC + N=8 inference. Tests fine-tuning intensity vs capability as degeneracy driver.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"train_loss_5epoch\": 0.095,\n      \"eval_loss_5epoch\": 0.105,\n      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.641,\n      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.782,\n      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 14.1,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_r8\": 0.12,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_r16_baseline\": 0.21,\n      \"degeneracy_delta_pp\": 9.0,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.365,\n      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.27,\n      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.195,\n      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.39,\n      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.69,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy_r8\": 0.641,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob_r8\": 0.644,\n      \"selection_f1_sj_r8\": 0.642,\n      \"selection_f1_oracle_r8\": 0.782,\n      \"selection_gap_logprob_minus_greedy_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"lp_within_instance_range_median_r8\": 0.048,\n      \"lp_tied_fraction_r8\": 0.14,\n      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.385,\n      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.568,\n      \"re_degeneracy_rate_r8\": 0.08,\n      \"re_sample_f1_pct_zero\": 48.2,\n      \"greedy_f1_delta_r8_minus_r16\": -0.022,\n      \"sj_rho_delta_r8_minus_r16\": 0.005,\n      \"headroom_delta_r8_minus_r16_pp\": 3.0,\n      \"non_degen_selection_gap_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"n_instances\": 529,\n      \"parse_rate\": 0.995\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: LoRA Rank Ablation — Degeneracy & Performance\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Rank=16 (baseline)\",\n          \"Rank=8\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"NER Greedy F1\",\n            \"0.663\",\n            \"0.641\",\n            \"-2.2pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NER Oracle F1\",\n            \"0.776\",\n            \"0.782\",\n            \"+0.6pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NER Headroom\",\n            \"11.3pp\",\n            \"14.1pp\",\n            \"+2.8pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NER Degeneracy %\",\n            \"21%\",\n            \"12%\",\n            \"-9pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LP range (median nats)\",\n            \"0.041\",\n            \"0.048\",\n            \"+17%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LP tied fraction\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"0.14\",\n            \"-7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NER SJ ρ\",\n            \"0.383\",\n            \"0.365\",\n            \"-0.018\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best selection F1\",\n            \"0.650 (LP)\",\n            \"0.644 (LP)\",\n            \"-0.6pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Degeneracy Attribution (NER)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Driver\",\n          \"Predicted Δ degen\",\n          \"Actual Δ degen\",\n          \"Attribution %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Capability (F1 drop 0.66→0.64)\",\n            \"-2pp\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"22%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fine-tuning intensity (rank 16→8)\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"-7pp\",\n            \"78%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total observed\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"-9pp\",\n            \"100%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Non-degenerate Subset Analysis (rank=8)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Subset\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"LP selection gap\",\n          \"SJ selection gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"All instances\",\n            \"529\",\n            \"+0.3pp\",\n            \"+0.1pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Non-degenerate only\",\n            \"465\",\n            \"+2.1pp\",\n            \"+1.5pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Non-degen, rank=16 baseline\",\n            \"418\",\n            \"+2.9pp (p=0.01)\",\n            \"+1.8pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LoRA rank=8 ablation 是 median tier 的 defining experiment。Degeneracy 下降 9pp（从 21% 到 12%）中，capability drop（F1 -2.2pp）仅能解释约 2pp，剩余 7pp 必须归因于 fine-tuning intensity itself。这迫使论文承认 capability trap 不是 sole driver——fine-tuning regime 是 independent contributing factor。但关键上下文是：跨 dataset 的 degeneracy variation（CoNLL 58% vs SciERC 21% = 37pp range）远大于 rank ablation 的 9pp，所以 capability 仍是 'dominant factor'。Paper framing 调整为：'Output convergence is driven by model capability (primary, explaining cross-dataset variance) AND fine-tuning intensity (secondary, contributing 5-15pp within-dataset). The capability trap remains the unifying explanation for why test-time scaling provides diminishing returns as model quality improves.' Selection 仍然 fails 即使 degeneracy 降低，因为 LP compression 是 independent bottleneck（不随 LoRA rank 改变）。\\n\\nLoRA rank=8 的参数容量是 rank=16 的一半，模型 fine-tuning 强度更低。这导致两个效果：(1) greedy F1 略降（0.641 vs 0.663，-2.2pp），因为模型对 SciERC schema 的记忆不如 rank=16 完整；(2) 输出多样性更高，因为 lower-rank adaptation 保留了更多 base model 的 stochastic behavior，degeneracy 从 21% 降到 12%（-9pp，落入 median 范围 [5,15]）。关键逻辑：如果 degeneracy 纯粹由 capability 驱动，则 F1 降低应该已经自动解释 degeneracy 下降（按 capability trap curve：F1 从 0.66 降到 0.64 预测 degeneracy 从 21% 降到 ~19%，仅 -2pp）。但实际下降 9pp >> 2pp 的 capability-predicted 下降，说明 fine-tuning intensity 本身是 independent contributing factor。Median 解读：capability trap 解释了约 22% 的 degeneracy reduction（2/9），fine-tuning intensity 解释了剩余 78%。但 capability 仍是跨 dataset 的 primary driver（CoNLL 58% vs SciERC 21% 的差异远大于 rank ablation 的 9pp）。LP compression 也略微缓解（range median 0.048 vs 0.041），因为 lower fine-tuning 保留了更多 generation-level diversity。Selection 仍不显著（+0.3pp），因为即使 degeneracy 降低，LP compression 仍存在。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"claim_audit\",\n    \"description\": \"Cross-chapter numerical consistency audit. 检查所有定量 claims vs source data。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"contradictions_found\": 3,\n      \"contradiction_1\": {\n        \"location\": \"Discussion vs Limitations\",\n        \"issue\": \"Discussion says '+0.1pp over single-sample', Limitations says '+0.4pp over greedy'\",\n        \"resolution\": \"Both refer to different comparisons: +0.1pp = best signal vs random single, +0.4pp (incorrect) should be +0.6pp = LP vs greedy (from exp_016_rerun_1024). Standardize to LP vs greedy +0.6pp throughout.\"\n      },\n      \"contradiction_2\": {\n        \"location\": \"Abstract vs Results\",\n        \"issue\": \"Abstract claims 'AUROC up to 0.82' but Results table shows max 0.749 (EM on NER)\",\n        \"resolution\": \"0.82 comes from CoNLL (SJ AUROC=0.8008 in exp_002, EM AUROC=0.8156). Must specify which dataset in Abstract or use max across all: CoNLL EM AUROC 0.82.\"\n      },\n      \"contradiction_3\": {\n        \"location\": \"Intro vs Section 5\",\n        \"issue\": \"Intro claims '21-58% of instances produce identical F1' — percentages are from 1024-token data but cited numbers use mixed sources\",\n        \"resolution\": \"Verify degeneracy rates from consistent 1024-token runs. SciERC (1024): ~21% (from exp_012_rerun_1024 tied fraction). CoNLL: derive from exp_002 data.\"\n      },\n      \"minor_issues_found\": 4,\n      \"total_resolution_time_hours\": 2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Claim Audit Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Issue Type\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"Severity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Major numerical contradiction\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"Must fix before submission\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Minor rounding/precision inconsistency\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"Fix in final pass\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Stale reference to old experiment\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"Update citation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Missing CI/p-value for claimed significance\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"Add from bootstrap data\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Audit 发现 3 个需要修正的矛盾，均为 presentation-level 问题。最关键的是 Discussion/Limitations 中对 selection gap magnitude 的不一致引用——这在 median tier 下尤其敏感，因为 adjusted claims 要求精确措辞（'predominantly fail' 而非 'universally fail'）。所有矛盾均可通过引用正确的 source experiment（exp_012_rerun_1024 为 SciERC 的 canonical source，exp_002 为 CoNLL）解决。无 methodological 问题。建议统一使用 1024-token pipeline 数据作为 paper 中所有 SciERC metrics 的来源。\\n\\nNumerical inconsistencies 是 paper 在多轮实验迭代中积累的必然结果。本项目经历了 512→1024 token 数据迁移、gold-empty filtering pipeline 修正、多 seed 数值更新等，每次都有部分 claims 未同步更新。Median tier 假设找到 3 个显著矛盾（realistic for a ~8-page paper with dense quantitative claims）而非 catastrophic level（>5）的问题。这些都是 presentational issues 而非 methodological problems——底层实验数据一致。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":609,"startLine":1,"totalLines":609}}}
